s 48–49"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 2.5, pp. 40–41; scans 48–49"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。双向机的越过右端接受约定见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"153cfd308604580f\" href=\"?note=153cfd308604580f\" title=\"73-df-two-way-dfa\">73-df-two-way-dfa</a>，正则语言见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}two\\text{-}way\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}regularity}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\leftrightarrow\\exists M\\;(\\operatorname{TwoDFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\land L=L(M))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}two\\text{-}way\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}regularity}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\leftrightarrow\\exists M\\;(\\operatorname{TwoDFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\land L=L(M))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>接受运行中，同一边界的交叉序列不能在同一方向重复状态，否则确定性使机器进入循环；方向交替，因此可能的有效序列有限。以这些序列作 NFA 状态，检查相邻边界的局部匹配即可模拟接受。反向将普通 DFA 的每步都设为右移。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-two-way-dfa","status":"resolved","id":"153cfd308604580f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-two-way-dfa]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-two-way-dfa","status":"resolved","id":"153cfd308604580f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。双向机的越过右端接受约定见 [[73-df-two-way-dfa]]，正则语言见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。双向机的越过右端接受约定见 [[73-df-two-way-dfa]]，正则语言见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}two\\text{-}way\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}regularity}\\vdash\nL\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\leftrightarrow\\exists M\\;(\\operatorname{TwoDFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\land L=L(M))","display":true}],"bytes":1787,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-394","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-two-way-dfa-regularity|双向 DFA 与正则语言等价]]"}],"outgoing":["153cfd308604580f","c284ffb568a496fd"]}